# vit_v0_default: ViT-Base/16 transfer baseline. Not a waterfall row. Rationale: GEOMETRY-TRANSFER.md
# (only finished system that loads and traces a model).
#
#     hidden 768, 12 layers, 12 heads, FFN 3072      identical to BERT-base
#     tokens 197 (196 patches + CLS) vs 128          geometry
#     Conv2d 16x16x3 patch projection vs
#       28,996-entry vocabulary lookup               architecture
#     no attention mask                              one encrypted operand fewer per layer
#     final LayerNorm + CLS slice, no pooler         head
#
# No levers (as s0_default). Checkpoint from a bound directory (image has BERT only, nodes offline);
# the sbatch's vit_* branch binds it and prints VIT_TRANSFER=1.
SHAFT_SCRIPT=$BASE/vit_instrumented_cpu.py
SHAFT_LEVERS=
SHAFT_INNER_ENV="SHAFT_MODEL=/vit"
